alse,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[32,26,78,70,79,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1018105","helmet":"WP1025905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[32,26,78,70,79,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1018105","helmet":"WP1025905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1006018","name":{"zh":"孙权逝世","en":"Passing of Sun Quan"},"year":"254","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1011218","name":{"zh":"孙亮被废","en":"Sun Liang Deposed"},"year":"258","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"东吴第二位皇帝，孙权幼子。聪慧早熟，孙权结束二宫之乱后立孙亮为皇太子。十岁登基，由大将军诸葛恪、孙峻等权臣辅政，皇权旁落。亲政后多次问责孙綝，追查朱公主被杀真相，后与全纪等良臣欲密谋除掉孙綝，无奈计划泄露，导致被孙亮所废。永安三年，被贬为侯官侯，前往封地途中离奇去世，年仅十八岁。","tc":"東吳第二位皇帝，孫權幼子。聰慧早熟，孫權結束二宮之亂后立孫亮為皇太子。十歲登基，由大將軍諸葛恪、孫峻等權臣輔政，皇權旁落。親政后多次問責孫綝，追查朱公主被殺真相，后與全紀等良臣欲密謀除掉孫綝，無奈計劃泄露，導致被孫亮所廢。永安三年，被貶為侯官侯，前往封地途中離奇去世，年僅十八歲。","en":"The second emperor of Eastern Wu and the youngest son of Sun Quan. Intelligent and precocious, Sun Liang was established as crown prince after Sun Quan ended the Struggle of the Two Palaces. He ascended the throne at age ten, with regents including Grand General Zhuge Ke and Sun Jun wielding real power while imperial authority waned. After assuming personal rule, Sun Liang repeatedly held Sun Chen accountable and investigated the truth behind Princess Zhu's murder. He conspired with loyal ministers such as Quan Ji to eliminate Sun Chen, but the plot was leaked, leading to his deposition by Sun Chen. In the third year of Yong'an, he was demoted to Marquis of Houguan and died mysteriously en route to his fief at the age of only eighteen.","jp":"東呉の第二代皇帝、孫権の末子。聡明で早熟であり、孫権が二宮の変を収拾した後に皇太子に立てられた。十歳で即位し、大将軍の諸葛恪や孫峻ら権臣が補政にあたったため、皇権は失墜した。親政後はたびたび孫綝の責任を追及し、朱公主殺害の真相を調査、後に全紀ら良臣とともに孫綝の排除を密謀するも計画が漏洩し、孫綝によって廃位された。永安三年、侯官侯に降格され、封地へ向かう途中で不可解な死を遂げた。享年十八。","kr":"동오의 제2대 황제이자 손권의 막내아들. 총명하고 조숙하여, 손권이 이궁의 변을 수습한 뒤 황태자로 책봉되었다. 10세의 나이로 즉위하였으나 대장군 제갈각, 손준 등 권신들이 보정을 맡으며 황권이 실추되었다. 친정한 뒤 여러 차례 손침을 문책하고 주공주가 살해당한 진상을 추적하였으며, 이후 전기 등 충신들과 함께 손침을 주살하려 모의했으나 안타깝게도 계획이 누설되어 결국 폐위당했다. 영안 3년, 후관후로 강등되어 봉지로 향하던 도중 의문의 죽음을 맞이하니 향년 18세였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10494","remark":"","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"亮","nameTc":"亮","nameEn":"Liang","nameJp":"亮","nameKr":"량","nameOther":"","word":"子明","wordTc":"子明","wordEn":"Ziming","wordJp":"子明","wordKr":"자명","wordOther":"","icon":"孙亮","power":"WJ10020","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"253","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"32","force":"26","wise":"78","politics":"70","charm":"79","will":"75","ruleTalent":"2","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"13","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"6/6/51/6/6/43/50/6","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1006305;1005805","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1000201","warSoulPoint":"1000","battleSoulPoint":"600","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"1010115","strategy2":"1008701","professions":"0/0/0/1/0/1/0/1/2/2/0/0/0/3/0/1/2/1/1/3/1/0/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"83","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1000","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"243","show":"252","death":"260","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1018105","helmet":"WP1025905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"",